fuel:sputtered_impurity rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf fuel:wall_released_species .


###  http://w3id.org/fuel/stability
fuel:stability rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf fuel:quality ;
